    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">During the financial year ended October 31, 2022, the Company
had four Named Executive Officers, being Adi Zuloff Shani (CEO), Oded Gilboa (CFO) and Alan Rootenberg (CFO) and Gadi Levin (former CEO
and CFO).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">The following table is a summary of compensation paid to
