Tel Aviv Stock Exchange<BR>
NASDAQ<BR>
Toronto Venture Stock Exchange</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="padding-top: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; border-right: black 1pt solid; border-bottom: black 1pt solid; border-left: black 1pt solid; padding-bottom: 5.4pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Yehonatan Shachar</FONT></TD>
